ata-local-id=\"dd4bd0c5-640b-4619-8fc6-5a6a64dd35d8\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"3c7035c702fa\" style=\"text-align: center;\">The status of the selection (ACTIVE, WINNER, LOSER, REMOVED, REMOVED_VACANT, HIDDEN, PLACED)</p></td><td data-local-id=\"4ef8789b-9e90-4750-8943-765e54268b2f\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p local-id=\"4b7788a9fd60\" style=\"text-align: center;\">string</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 local-id=\"40b9f382-3fa2-4180-b6e2-d87e77c4fa61\" id=\"ExchangeStreamAPI-KeyLineSelectionFields\">KeyLineSelection Fields</h2><p local-id=\"8b021d3150fc\">Description of a markets key line selection, comprising the selectionId and handicap of the team it is applied to.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-local-id=\"1aac70b9-cfb8-4c84-80da-e0db63926696\" data-macro-id=\"dbe04135-5247-45d1-af5c-d0e25d6ca12f\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p local-id=\"5d91b65d8ef5\"><strong>Please Note </strong>- The KeyLine selection returned via the Exchange Stream API is based on raw (non <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/1smk3cen4v3lu3yomq5qye0ni/pages/2686993/Additional+Information#VirtualBets\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2686993\" data-linked-resource-version=\"68\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">virtual prices</a>) only. </p></div></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-table-width=\"1800\" data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"914b78cf-6fbf-4ef7-aadd-d6ccbfc936cf\" class=\"confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 340.0px;\" /><col style=\"width: 713.0px;\" /><col style=\"width: 713.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr data-local-id=\"dbf15ba5-7990-466c-a736-29eb015049c4\"><th data-highlight-colour=\"var(--ds-background-accent-gray-subtlest, var(--ds-background-accent-gray-subtlest, #F1F2F4))\" data-local-id=\"9da7d57d-